    "block.zps.radio_receiver.zps_tooltip": "Receives a radio signal and sends the data over a [Data Cable].\n\nTune the radio frequency with [Shift + Right Click]. Higher frequencies have a longer range and require a taller [Radio Antenna] on top.",

    "block.zps.loudspeaker.zps_tooltip": "Converts messages from a [Data Cable] into spoken audio.",

    "block.zps.data_comparator.zps_tooltip": "Compares signals from two connected [Data Cables] according to the current mode.\n\n[Equals]: provides Redstone power when data from the two inputs match exactly.\n\n[Contains]: provides Redstone power when data from the first input contains the full data from the second.\n\n[Greater Than]: provides Redstone power when both inputs can be parsed as numbers and the first is greater than the second.\n\n[Shift + R-Click] to switch Modes.",

    "block.zps.data_combinator.zps_tooltip": "Combines two [Data Cable] inputs into one output according to the current mode.\n\n[Back]: output port.\n[Left]: Input A. [Right]: Input B.\n\n[Append]: passthrough behavior for single inputs, and appends Input B to Input A when both are present.\n\n[Replace]: passthrough from Input A unless Input B is present and Input A contains [%s], in which case the first occurrence is replaced with Input B.\n\n[Shift + R-Click] to switch Modes.",

